.TH PARCEL\-EVENTS\-CLI\-SHIPMENTS 1 "Doctorine" "1.8.4"
.SH NAME
parcel\-events\-cli\-shipments \- shipments commands for parcel\-events\-cli
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B parcel\-events\-cli shipments
<verb> [flags]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Group page for \fBshipments\fR. One page per group, not per leaf.
Stable bind id is \fBx\-operation\-key\fR.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP "shipments cancel"
DELETE /v1/shipments/{shipment_id}
.IP "shipments create"
POST /v1/shipments
.IP "shipments events list"
GET /v1/shipments/{shipment_id}/events
.IP "shipments list"
GET /v1/shipments
.IP "shipments retrieve"
GET /v1/shipments/{shipment_id}
.IP "shipments update"
PATCH /v1/shipments/{shipment_id}
